13333405222_2512720116299333632_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mqwzlhktLBQQ7kNvwFqpkYe&_nc_oc=Adovc5HHX-MWWCzuJvH6Z_-ImC58YMAf3yHU0APX0S6vgF7anvNsLZSW3A8UyWunFhU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTShRaymL-pcwG3IHcWEryY27Kh8h509Na8vcYVvUR09A&oe=6AEC8B0F"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "145889513396929", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162683_1903711136535900_2856710528141623296_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bLA3PLgfA6oQ7kNvwEINzmf&_nc_oc=Adr_hcvTlfk4r1MI2Otw__LdcBfNjq7l2cO-eY2m42-UG22kF6LP5AelqZopE1WJLhc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRnVHcXzhDhpQ40sIxdl4k1kSM-3YTWt0bYlVFrvQi3bw&oe=6AECA4CF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Chase 'n Hunt", "keywords": ["Hunt", "Openseason", "Hunter", "Telescopic", "Gun"], "long_description": "An extraordinary FPS hunting experience in Gear VR.\nChase, Target and Shoot at the head of your prey. Meanwhile collect gold & ammo to level up your telescopic sniper rifle but always be on your toes, cause in this game there is a fair chance you might get hunted! \n\n*Additional features\nThe Animals have limited AI.\nThree different levels, and more to come.\nLow poly environment.\nOnly 70 MB free space required.\n\n*How To Play\n1. Tap and hold on touchpad to WALK.\n2. Single or Double Tap to SHOOT.\n3. Swipe Up for telescopic ZOOM sight.", "short_description": "Welcome to an unique First Person experience to chase and hunt in a low poly VR Open Season. Don't go easy with the hunting habitat, There's a fair chance you might get Hunted!\nPlease note: ONLY HEADSHOT COUNTS."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.deepbrain.xyz/chase_n_hunt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.deepbrain.xyz/chase_n_hunt", "publisher_name": "Pixelwave", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.deepbrain.xyz/chase_n_h